      "title": "去世",
      "summary": "《十国春秋》在幼年移濠州后记母刘氏未几去世；无独立卒年。",
      "year": null,
      "precision": "undated",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "sortOrder": 4,
      "sourceDate": "移至濠州后未几；无独立年月",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "shiguochunqiu-v015",
